@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home - Workflow Dashboard</PageTitle>

<h1>Workflow Dashboard</h1>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Upload Workflows</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Upload a zip of workflow DLLs or a build-time diagrams package (<code>workflow-diagrams.zip</code>) to discover and visualize Temporal workflows.</p>
                <a href="/upload" class="btn btn-primary">Upload Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">View Workflows</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Browse all discovered workflows and view their Mermaid diagrams.</p>
                <a href="/workflows" class="btn btn-primary">View Workflows</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Diagramming Guide</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Two ways to produce diagrams: curated <strong>attributes</strong> on your code, or <strong>Roslyn</strong> analysis of normal Temporal workflows (no annotations).</p>
                <a href="/guide" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Open Guide</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Mermaid to Workflow</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Paste a Mermaid flowchart and generate a starter C# workflow with diagram attributes applied.</p>
                <a href="/wizard" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Open Wizard</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>This dashboard allows you to:</p>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li>Upload zip files containing Temporal workflow DLLs <em>or</em> pre-built Mermaid diagram packages</li>
                    <li>Discover workflows from annotated assemblies or from build-time Roslyn/attribute diagram zips</li>
                    <li>View workflow diagrams in Mermaid format</li>
                    <li>Learn either diagramming path in the <a href="/guide">Diagramming Guide</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
